   "old": "<tr><td data-th=\"Word(s)\">amide</td><td data-th=\"Definition\">A compound with a carbonyl bonded to a nitrogen, R&ndash;CO&ndash;NR<sub>2</sub>; amides are neutral (not basic). The peptide bond is an amide bond.<br /><span lang=\"es\"><em>Espa&ntilde;ol:</em> amida</span></td><td data-th=\"Image\">&nbsp;</td><td data-th=\"Caption\">&nbsp;</td><td data-th=\"Link\"><a href=\"/@go/page/597123\">Section 7.3</a></td><td data-th=\"Source\">CC BY 4.0; Daniel Kwasniewski</td></tr>",
